{"output":"I’ll inspect the project authorization and cache paths, fix the isolation issues, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject detail reads lack an ownership check, list keys omit the organization, and updates leave cached lists intact. I’ll add the membership check and an organization-specific cache prefix, then test revocation, list variants, and invalidation boundaries.\n\nFixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves all pagination/sorting parameters, and invalidates every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0. No blockers.","final_output":"Fixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves all pagination/sorting parameters, and invalidates every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0. No blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":23,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/tenant-cache-3-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":199,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-b7c79762406e67893aabe50eadb4119d.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read